/github.com/openscriptures/strongs", "attribution": "Based on the work of Larry Pierce at the Online Bible", "attribution_url": "http://www.blueletterbible.org/contact/contact_gen.cfm"}}, {"headword": "אַרְבַּע", "parent_lexicon": "Jastrow Dictionary", "rid": "A02968", "refs": ["Jastrow, אַרְבָּעָה I 1", "Jastrow, אַרְבְּעָה 1"], "content": {"senses": [{"definition": "<i>four</i>, v. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אַרְבָּעָה I.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אַרְבָּעָה I 1\"><span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְבָּעָא</span> I</a> a. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אַרְבְּעָה.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אַרְבְּעָה 1\"><a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אַרְבְּעָה.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אַרְבְּעָה 1\">אַרְבְּעָה</a>.</a>"}]}, "quotes": [], "prev_hw": "אַרְבֵּסְרָאָה", "next_hw": "אַרְבְּעָא", "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Jastrow Dictionary", "language": "heb.talmudic", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "Jastrow Dictionary", "attribution": "Rabbi Marcus Jastrow", "index_title": "Jastrow", "version_title": "London, Luzac, 1903", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "רְבַע", "parent_lexicon": "Jastrow Dictionary", "rid": "T00129", "language_code": " ch. ", "refs": ["Jastrow, רָבַע 1", "Yoma 2a", "Bereishit Rabbah 7:2", "Pesikta Rabbati 14:1", "Kohelet Rabbah 1:8:1", "Shevuot 22b", "Avodah Zarah 24a:11", "Bamidbar Rabbah 19:3", "Bava Kamma 114a:4", "Eruvin 57a:8"], "language_reference": "<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_רָבַע.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, רָבַע 1\">same</a>", "content": {"senses": [{"definition": "<i>to lie, couch</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Numbers.22.27\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Numbers 22:27\">Targ. Num. XXII, 27</a> (h. text <span dir=\"rtl\">רבץ</span>). <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Genesis.49.25\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Genesis 49:25\">Targ. Y. Gen. XLIX, 25</a>; a. fr.—Part. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_רְבִיעַ.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, רְבִיעַ 1\">רְבִיעַ</a>; f. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_רְבִיעָה.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, רְבִיעָה 1\">רְבִיעָא</a>; pl. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_רְבִיעִין.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, רְבִיעִין 1\">רְבִיעִין</a>; <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_רְבִיעָה.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, רְבִיעָה 1\">רְבִיעָן</a>. Ib. IV, 7. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Deuteronomy.22.6\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Deuteronomy 22:6\">Targ. Deut. XXII, 6</a> (O. ed. Vien. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_רִבְעָא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, רִבְעָא 1\">רְבֵעָא</a>). <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Aramaic_Targum_to_Psalms.104.22\" data-ref=\"Aramaic Targum to Psalms 104:22\">Targ. Ps. CIV, 22</a>; a. fr.—Y. Ber. VIII, 12ᵇ top <span dir=\"rtl\">לא מיסתך דאת ר׳ וכ׳</span> is it not not enough that thou art lying (on the dining couch), and he stands and attends thee? <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Yoma.2a\" data-ref=\"Yoma 2a\">Ib.</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גזירנא דהוא ר׳ וכ׳</span> (not <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_גזירה.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, גזירה 1\">גזירה</a>) I decree that he lie down, and thou stand &c. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Bereishit_Rabbah.7.2\" data-ref=\"Bereishit Rabbah 7:2\">Gen. R. s. 7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">רביע ואנא וכ׳</span> lie down (to be lashed), and I will tell thee; Tanḥ. Ḥuck. 6; <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Pesikta_Rabbati.14.1\" data-ref=\"Pesikta Rabbati 14:1\">Pesik. R. s. 14</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Kohelet_Rabbah.1.8.1\" data-ref=\"Kohelet Rabbah 1:8:1\">Koh. R. to I, 8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">קם ור׳ ליה על רגלוי</span> he arose and threw himself down at his feet. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Shevuot.22b\" data-ref=\"Shevuot 22b\">Shebu. 22ᵇ</a>, a. fr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אריא הוא דר׳ וכ׳</span>, v. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_אֲרִי.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, אֲרִי 1\">אַרְיָא</a>; a. fr.", "number": "1)"}, {"definition": "<i>to commit buggery</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Avodah_Zarah.24a.11\" data-ref=\"Avodah Zarah 24a:11\">Ab. Zar. 24ᵃ</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">דילמא רַבְעוּהָ לאימא דאימא</span> perhaps they (gentiles) had connection with the grandmother (of the animal, while she was pregnant); a. e.", "number": "—2)"}, {"grammar": {"binyan_form": ["אַרְבַּע"], "verbal_stem": "Af."}, "senses": [{"definition": "<i>to cause to lie down, lay down</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Genesis.24.11\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Genesis 24:11\">Targ. Y. Gen. XXIV, 11</a> (h. text <span dir=\"rtl\">ויברך</span>). <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Deuteronomy.25.2\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Deuteronomy 25:2\">Targ. Y. Deut. XXV, 2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ויַרְבְּעִינֵיה</span> (not <span dir=\"rtl\">ויִרְ׳</span>).—Part. pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְבַּע</span>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Genesis.49.14\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Genesis 49:14\">Targ. Y. I Gen. XLIX, 14</a>.—<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Bamidbar_Rabbah.19.3\" data-ref=\"Bamidbar Rabbah 19:3\">Num. R. s. 19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְבְּעוּנֵיה דילקי</span> lay him down, that he may receive lashes; Tanḥ. l. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">ארבעתיה</span> (corr. acc.); ib. <span dir=\"rtl\">ארבעונהי</span> (corr. acc.). Pesik. R. l. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְבְּעִינֵיה</span> lay thou him down. Y. Bicc. I, 64ᵃ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְבְּעֵיה על וכ׳</span> he ordered him to be laid on the benches (for punishment). <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Bava_Kamma.114a.4\" data-ref=\"Bava Kamma 114a:4\">B. Kam. 114ᵃ</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְבְּעֵית לי אריא וכ׳</span> thou didst put a lion at my borders, i.e. you forced a violent neighbor upon me; a. e.—Y. Yeb. IV, 6ᵃ bot. <span dir=\"rtl\">ואנא בעי מַרְבַּעְתָּהּ וכ׳</span> and I want to assist at her lying down (for delivery), before she cools off, v. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_צְנַן.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, צְנַן 1\">צְנַן</a>.", "number": "1)"}, {"definition": "<i>to copulate animals</i>, esp. <i>to hybridize</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Genesis.36.24\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Genesis 36:24\">Targ. Y. Gen. XXXVI, 24</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Leviticus.19.19\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Leviticus 19:19\">Targ. Y. Lev. XIX, 19</a>.", "number": "—2)"}]}, {"grammar": {"binyan_form": ["רַבֵּעַ"], "verbal_stem": "Pa."}, "senses": [{"definition": "<i>to divide into four parts</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Deuteronomy.32.4\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Deuteronomy 32:4\">Targ. Y. Deut. XXXII, 4</a>.", "number": "1)"}, {"definition": "<i>to make quadrangular.</i> <i> Part. pass</i>. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרַבַּע</span> (מְרֻבַּע Hebraism); f. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרַבְּעָא</span>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְּרַבְּעִין</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרַבְּעָן</span>, <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_מַרְבַּעְתָּא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, מַרְבַּעְתָּא 1\">מְרַבְּעָתָא</a> <i>quadrate</i>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Onkelos_Exodus.27.1\" data-ref=\"Onkelos Exodus 27:1\">Targ. Ex. XXVII, 1</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Ezekiel.45.2\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Ezekiel 45:2\">Targ. Ez. XLV, 2</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_I_Kings.7.5\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on I Kings 7:5\">Targ. I Kings VII, 5</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Numbers.33.7\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Numbers 33:7\">Targ. Y. I Num. XXXIII, 7</a> (not <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵרַבְ׳</span>); <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Targum_Jonathan_on_Exodus.14.2\" data-ref=\"Targum Jonathan on Exodus 14:2\">Targ. Y. I Ex. XIV, 2</a> (ed. Vien. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_מַרְבִּיעֲתָא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, מַרְבִּיעֲתָא 1\">מרביעתא</a>, corr. acc.); a. e.—Y. Sot. V, 20ᵇ bot. <span dir=\"rtl\">מאן דמְרַבַּע ארבע וכ׳</span> he that wants to form four rows of four casks each requires sixteen casks. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Eruvin.57a.8\" data-ref=\"Eruvin 57a:8\">Erub. 57ᵃ</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אימור … כמאן דמְרַבְּעָא רַבּוּעֵי ודאי מי מְרַבַּעְנָא</span> we said, we consider it in our calculations as if it were squared; do we, however, really make it a square (by filling the space with buildings)?; a. e.", "number": "—2)"}]}]}, "plural_form": ["רְבִיעִין", "רְבִיעָן", "מְּרַבְּעִין", "מְרַבְּעָן", "מְרַבְּעָתָא"], "alt_headwords": ["רְבִיעַ"], "quotes": [], "prev_hw": "רָבַע", "next_hw": "רֶבַע", "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Jastrow Dictionary", "language": "heb.talmudic", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "Jastrow Dictionary", "attribution": "Rabbi Marcus Jastrow", "index_title": "Jastrow", "version_title": "London, Luzac, 1903", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "אַרְבַּע", "parent_lexicon": "Klein Dictionary", "content": {"morphology": "f.", "senses": [{"definition": ", <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_אַרְבָּעָה.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, אַרְבָּעָה 1\">אַרְבָּעָה</a> m. adj. four."}]}, "rid": "A02051", "refs": ["Klein Dictionary, אַרְבָּעָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, אַרְבָּעָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, רבע ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, אַרְבַּע 1", "Klein Dictionary, אַרְבָּעָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, רבע ᴵ 1", "Klein Dictionary, אַרְבַּע 1", "Klein Dictionary, אַרְבָּעָה 1", "Klein Dictionary, אַרְבָּעִים 1", "Klein Dictionary, אַרְבָּעוֹן 1", "Klein Dictionary, אַרְבַּעְתַּֽיִם 1", "Klein Dictionary, אַרְבָּעִים 1", "Klein Dictionary, אַרְבָּעוֹן 1", "Klein Dictionary, אַרְבַּעְתַּֽיִם 1"], "derivatives": "Derivatives: <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_אַרְבָּעִים.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, אַרְבָּעִים 1\">אַרֽבָּעִים</a>, <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,_אַרְבָּעוֹן.1\" data-ref=\"Klein Dictionary, אַרְבָּעוֹן 1\">אַרֽבָּעוֹן</a>, <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Klein Dictionary,