"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs", "index_title": "BDB", "version_title": "A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "אַרְבַּע", "parent_lexicon": "BDB Aramaic Dictionary", "content": {"senses": [{"definition": "v. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, רבע\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_רבע\", dir=\"rtl\">רבע</a>."}]}, "rid": "BDBA0083", "strong_numbers": ["702", "703", "704", "706"], "next_hw": "אַרְגְּוָן", "prev_hw": "אֶצְבַּע", "quotes": [], "GK": ["752", "753"], "TWOT": ["2106a", "2986a"], "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "BDB Aramaic Dictionary", "language": "ara.biblical", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "BDB Dictionary", "attribution": "F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs", "index_title": "BDB Aramaic", "version_title": "A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "אַרְבַּע²", "parent_lexicon": "BDB Aramaic Dictionary", "content": {"senses": [{"definition": "<strong>n.m.</strong> et <strong>f. four</strong>;—"}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<strong> m.</strong>: bef. <strong>n.fpl.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:2\" href=\"/Daniel.7.2\">Dn 7:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:3\" href=\"/Daniel.7.3\">3</a>; <strong>n.fs.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מְאָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:17\" href=\"/Ezra.6.17\">Ezr 6:17</a>; after <strong>n.fpl.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:6\" href=\"/Daniel.7.6\">Dn 7:6</a>; as pred. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְבַּ֑ע</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:17\" href=\"/Daniel.7.17\">17</a>."}], "num": "1."}, {"senses": [{"definition": "<strong> f.:</strong> bef. <strong>n.m.pl.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:6\" href=\"/Daniel.7.6\">Dn 7:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:17\" href=\"/Daniel.7.17\">17</a>; after <strong>n.m.pl.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:25\" href=\"/Daniel.3.25\">3:25</a>."}], "num": "2."}]}, "rid": "BDBA0715", "strong_numbers": ["702", "703", "704", "706"], "next_hw": "רְבִיעִי", "prev_hw": "רבע", "all_cited": true, "alt_headwords": [{"word": "אַרְבְּעָה"}], "quotes": [], "GK": ["752", "753"], "TWOT": ["2106a", "2986a"], "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "BDB Aramaic Dictionary", "language": "ara.biblical", "to_language": "eng", "text_categories": [], "source": "BDB Dictionary", "attribution": "F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs", "index_title": "BDB Aramaic", "version_title": "A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906", "version_lang": "en", "should_autocomplete": true}}, {"headword": "אַרְבַּע", "parent_lexicon": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "content": {"definition": ["<p><sup class=\"footnote-marker\">3</sup><i class=\"footnote\">מן <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Ben_Yehuda_Dictionary,_רבע_I.1\" data-ref=\"Ben Yehuda Dictionary, רבע I 1\">רבע</a>,  עי\"ש, משתפ' בו כל לשונ' השמיות.</i>, -בָּע, ש\"מ לנק', לזכ' -בָּעָה, סמי' -בַּעַת, כנ' -בַּעְתָּם, -תָּן, – שלשה ואחד, שתים כפול שתים, vier; quatre; four: אַרְבַּע טבעת זהב (<span class=\"by-source\">שמו' כה יב</span>). שרץ העוף ההלך על אַרְבַּע (<span class=\"by-source\">ויקר' יא כא</span>). אַרְבָּעָה מלכים את החמשה (<span class=\"by-source\">בראש' יד ט</span>). – ובצרוף למספר עשרה, לנק': ערים אַרְבַּע- עֶשְׂרֵה וחצריהן (<span class=\"by-source\">יהוש' טו לו</span>). – ולז': עד אַרְבָּעָה עָשָׂר יום (<span class=\"by-source\">שמות יב ו</span>), כדין המספרים מעשרה ומעלה. – ויבוא גם בנסמך, אם המספר הוא ידוע: ואת אַרְבַּעַת הבקר (<span class=\"by-source\">במדב' ז ז</span>). אַרְבַּעַת גברי השערים (<span class=\"by-source\">דהי\"א ט כו</span>). על אַרְבַּעַת רבעיהם (<span class=\"by-source\">יחזק' א ח</span>). – ויבוא גם בלי הידיעה בנפרד: אַרְבַּעַת ימים בשנה (<span class=\"by-source\">שופט' יא מ</span>). אַרְבַּעַת אלפים ושש מאות (<span class=\"by-source\">דהי\"א יב כז</span>). כְּאַרְבַּעַת אלפים איש (<span class=\"by-source\">ש\"א ד ב</span>).  – ובכנויים: והילדים האלה אַרְבַּעְתָּם (<span class=\"by-source\">דני' א יז</span>), לאמר כל ארבעה האלה. דמות אחד לְאַרְבַּעְתָּם (<span class=\"by-source\">יחזק' י י</span>).</p>"]}, "rid": "BY-01171", "prev_hw": "אֻרְבָּן", "next_hw": "אַרְבָּעָה", "page_num": 378, "parent_lexicon_details": {"name": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "language": "heb", "to_language": "heb", "text_categories": [], "index_title": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "version_title": "Ben Yehuda Dictionary", "version_lang": "he", "should_autocomplete": true}}]